    "text": "A particle starts from origin <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> from rest and moves with a uniform acceleration along the positive <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> . Identify all figures that correctly represent the motion qualitatively.<br />( <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo></math> acceleration, <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo></math> velocity, <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> dispalcement, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo></math> time)<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0126_34193a0e41c1.png\" /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0126_ae113670ae92.png\" /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0126_390126f1d1d5.png\" /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img src=\"assets\\qt0126_7917889d26d8.png\" />"
  },
