  "solution": {
    "text": "A. Acceleration <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> constant; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> graph will be constant line parallel to time axis. Option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct. <br/>B. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> ; velocity vs time graph will be straight line passing through origin. Option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> initially at rest <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo></math> at <br/>C. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> (particle was initially at origin) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> graph will be parabola passing through origin. Option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct."
